# Raw waveform data from FDSN. Large, and always re-downloadable.
# Intermediate products: Whale-VAD frame probabilities, spectrogram caches,
# and per-note detection tables. Frame probabilities alone run to roughly
# 18 GB per Nov-Mar season (50 frames/s x 7 classes x float32).
#
# Both are reconstructible from manifests/, which IS committed.
#
# Note the `dir/*` plus negation form. A bare `data/` would ignore the
# directory itself, taking the README that explains it along with everything
# else, and the explanation would never reach anyone cloning the repo.
data/*
!data/README.txt

work/*
!work/README.txt

.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
__marimo__/
.DS_Store
